Morgan is an HTTP request logger middleware for Express.

Install:
npm install morgan


Use in server.js:
const morgan = require("morgan");

app.use(morgan("dev"));


Example terminal output:
GET /api/users 200
POST /api/users 201
GET /unknown 404


Why logging?
- Monitor API requests.
- Identify errors.
- Debug application issues.
- Track server activity.
Never log passwords, JWT tokens, or sensitive personal data
